values.content:
Build a meeting agenda.

Meeting: {{ $json.meetingTitle }}
Type: {{ $json.meetingType.replace(/_/g,' ') }}
Purpose: {{ $json.meetingPurpose }}
Attendees: {{ $json.attendees.join(', ') }}
Duration: {{ $json.durationMinutes }} minutes
Organizer: {{ $json.organizerName || 'not specified' }}

Topics to cover:
{{ $json.topicsToCover.join('\n') || 'not specified — infer from purpose' }}

Decisions needed:
{{ $json.decisionsNeeded.join('\n') || 'none specified' }}

Prior meeting notes / context:
{{ $json.priorMeetingNotes || 'none — first meeting or no context provided' }}

Return JSON:
{"agenda_title":"...","meeting_goal":"1-2 sentences — the single most important outcome of this meeting","agenda_items":[{"item":"specific agenda item","time_minutes":10,"desired_outcome":"what should be true when this item ends — decision made, info shared, alignment reached","owner":"who leads this item","type":"decision|discussion|update|brainstorm|action_review"}],"pre_read_suggestions":["things attendees should review before the meeting"],"parking_lot_note":"guidance on handling off-topic items that come up","success_criteria":["2-3 specific things that indicate this meeting succeeded"],"facilitator_notes":"1-2 tips for the meeting organizer specific to this meeting type and topics"}

Make sure time_minutes for all items sum to approximately {{ $json.durationMinutes }} minutes (leave 5 min buffer at start/end if duration allows).
